## Output format (follow it exactly)
Write the narration first, then give two choices. Output only the tags and content below, with no text outside the tags:

<narrative>
The narration
</narrative>
<options>
1. Choice one
2. Choice two
</options>

Choices:
- Exactly 2, with intentions that don't overlap (for example, one pushes forward directly and one tries a different angle).
- Both are concrete actions the protagonist can take right now, each no longer than 10 words.
- Don't spoil what comes later or make decisions the player hasn't made.
